    "body": "@lyzadanger that would be awesome! Thanks!\r\n\r\nI think this could be automated by checking https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-window-screenx et al. Although the features for window.open needs to be defined in terms of https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#web-exposed-screen-area as well so they match up (and to fix the privacy leak for window.open). (Edit: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/1143/commits/7e04f5ceb41573d99b179dd6b44d1d247bf42cee )\r\n\r\nAnother problem is that doing anything with *features* is optional (other than `noopener`), but I guess we can add metadata to the tests to that effect.",
