    "created_at": "2017-04-03T15:06:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-03T15:06:58Z",
    "body": "It's a non-separator. Happy to spec WebKit-like instead on that point.\r\n\r\nAnother interesting bit is U+000C, which only Gecko treats as a separator character. Likely it is Web-compatible to treat it as a separator so this is more consistent with everything else.",
